<title>FRANCE: French radio says unemployment rises in August.</title>
<headline>French radio says unemployment rises in August.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>French radio France Inter said on Friday that unemployment had risen by 39,500 in August.</p>
<p>The official French unemployment figures for August are due for release at 0645 GMT on Friday.</p>
<p>The radio did not elaborate beyond the figure of a rise of 39,500.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
